<Layout title="About Wade Olcott" description="Meet Wade Olcott, founder of RevLytics: an experienced Revenue Operations leader who values straightforward communication, collaboration, and accountability."><section class="wrap page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">About Wade Olcott</p><h1>A small practice.<br/>A personal commitment.</h1></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap grid md:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] gap-12 md:gap-24 items-start"><Portrait/><div class="prose"><h2>Hi, I'm Wade.</h2><p>I've spent more than 20 years working in sales operations, revenue strategy, analytics, forecasting, and sales technology, including VP-level leadership roles at Visa and Cybersource.</p><p>What I enjoy most is working inside a business: understanding the challenges, getting to know the people, and helping turn priorities into progress.</p><p>I founded RevLytics to keep doing that work in a more personal way. Rather than build a traditional consulting agency, I work closely with one or two companies as an embedded, part-time member of their leadership teams.</p><p>I value straightforward communication, collaboration, and accountability. I want the people I work with to know where things stand and feel that they have someone alongside them who is invested in the work.</p><a class="text-link" href="/how-i-work">How that translates into a partnership →</a></div></div></section><ContactCTA/></Layout>
